WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:04.965 --> 00:00:05.631
&gt;&gt; Tucker: AMERICA ISN'T THE

00:00:05.632 --> 00:00:07.766
ONLY COUNTRY FACING ECONOMIC

00:00:07.767 --> 00:00:09.201
PRESSURE AND SOCIAL VOLATILITY

00:00:09.202 --> 00:00:11.470
FROM UNRESTRAINED IMMIGRATION.

00:00:11.471 --> 00:00:14.006
JUST THREE YEARS AGO EUROPE

00:00:14.007 --> 00:00:15.608
FACED ITS OWN WAVE OF MIGRANTS

00:00:15.609 --> 00:00:18.244
FROM AFRICA AND THE MIDDLE

00:00:18.245 --> 00:00:18.611
EAST.

00:00:18.612 --> 00:00:20.246
THE GERMAN CHANCELLOR ANGELA

00:00:20.247 --> 00:00:21.380
MERKEL RESPONDS TO THIS BY

00:00:21.381 --> 00:00:22.681
ACCEPTING NEARLY A MILLION

00:00:22.682 --> 00:00:24.250
MIGRANTS IN A SINGLE YEAR.

00:00:24.251 --> 00:00:25.718
ADJUSTED FOR POPULATION THAT

00:00:25.719 --> 00:00:27.553
WOULD BE LIKE THIS COUNTRY

00:00:27.554 --> 00:00:29.154
TAKING IN 4 MILLION IN 12

00:00:29.155 --> 00:00:29.488
MONTHS.

00:00:29.489 --> 00:00:32.291
THREE YEARS AFTER THAT, HOW

00:00:32.292 --> 00:00:33.893
HAS THAT DECISION AFFECTED

00:00:33.894 --> 00:00:37.029
GERMANY AND MERKEL'S POLITICAL

00:00:37.030 --> 00:00:37.363
CAREER?

00:00:37.364 --> 00:00:41.367
RICK GEMEL IS THE CURRENT

00:00:41.368 --> 00:00:43.168
AMBASSADOR TO GERMANY AND IS

00:00:43.169 --> 00:00:43.602
JOINING US.

00:00:43.603 --> 00:00:44.737
THANK YOU FOR COMING ON.

00:00:44.738 --> 00:00:45.704
&gt;&gt; THANK YOU FOR HAVING ME.

00:00:45.705 --> 00:00:46.372
&gt;&gt; Tucker: YOU ARE SEEING

00:00:46.373 --> 00:00:47.406
THE FIGURES ON THE LEFT,

00:00:47.407 --> 00:00:51.810
HILLARY CLINTON AND JOHN

00:00:51.811 --> 00:00:53.846
KERRY, BUT OTHERS RETHINKING

00:00:53.847 --> 00:00:55.347
THE POLITICAL FALL OUT OF

00:00:55.348 --> 00:00:56.682
MERKEL'S DECISION TO DO THAT.

00:00:56.683 --> 00:00:58.017
FROM WHERE YOU SIT WHAT WAS

00:00:58.018 --> 00:00:59.952
THE EFFECT OF LETTING IN THE

00:00:59.953 --> 00:01:00.452
MIGRANTS?

00:01:00.453 --> 00:01:01.220
&gt;&gt; FIRST, TALK ABOUT THE

00:01:01.221 --> 00:01:06.191
POLITICAL EFFECT.

00:01:06.192 --> 00:01:07.626
THERE WAS NO PLAN IN PLACE SO

00:01:07.627 --> 00:01:09.929
THE POLICY FELL APART.

00:01:09.930 --> 00:01:11.463
CHANCELLOR MERKEL AND MANY IN

00:01:11.464 --> 00:01:12.698
GERMANY HAD BIG HEARTS.

00:01:12.699 --> 00:01:13.899
THEY WANTED TO DO SOMETHING

00:01:13.900 --> 00:01:16.302
BUT THERE WASN'T A PLAN.

00:01:16.303 --> 00:01:18.504
SO, EVEN CHANCELLOR MERKEL ALL

00:01:18.505 --> 00:01:20.439
THE YEARS LATER AGREED THAT

00:01:20.440 --> 00:01:24.677
THERE WAS NO PLAN.

00:01:24.678 --> 00:01:28.347
AND THEREFORE THE POLICY FELL

00:01:28.348 --> 00:01:28.714
APART.

00:01:28.715 --> 00:01:32.851
IT WASN'T IMPLEMENTED WITH

00:01:32.852 --> 00:01:33.819
HARDCORE SECURITY MEASURES.

00:01:33.820 --> 00:01:35.621
AND FOLLOW-UP.

00:01:35.622 --> 00:01:37.256
SO FROM THE POLITICAL

00:01:37.257 --> 00:01:40.392
STANDPOINT, NEXT WEEK,

00:01:40.393 --> 00:01:42.361
CHANCELLOR MERKEL IS GIVING UP

00:01:42.362 --> 00:01:44.797
HER CHAIRMANSHIP OF THE PARTY.

00:01:44.798 --> 00:01:47.800
THERE ARE THREE OTHER PEOPLE

00:01:47.801 --> 00:01:49.501
RUNNING AND THE TOP ISSUE IS

00:01:49.502 --> 00:01:51.770
MIGRATION AND HER HANDLING OF

00:01:51.771 --> 00:01:52.304
MIGRATION.

00:01:52.305 --> 00:01:54.173
POLITICALLY I'D SAY IT TOPPLED

00:01:54.174 --> 00:01:55.741
HER AND HAS FORCED HER NOW TO

00:01:55.742 --> 00:02:00.279
GIVE UP THE CHAIRMANSHIP OF A

00:02:00.280 --> 00:02:03.182
PARTY SHE ONCE RAN WITH A

00:02:03.183 --> 00:02:05.651
STRONG ARM.

00:02:05.652 --> 00:02:06.719
&gt;&gt; Tucker: WHAT IS SO

00:02:06.720 --> 00:02:07.820
INTERESTING WATCHING GERMANY

00:02:07.821 --> 00:02:08.821
FROM HERE IS HOW THE GERMAN

00:02:08.822 --> 00:02:10.689
PRESS AND THE CULTURAL LEADERS

00:02:10.690 --> 00:02:11.090
RESPONDED.

00:02:11.091 --> 00:02:12.558
THIS WAS THREE YEARS AGO AND

00:02:12.559 --> 00:02:13.892
IT WAS OBVIOUS ORDINARY

00:02:13.893 --> 00:02:14.994
GERMANS DIDN'T LIKE IT AND IT

00:02:14.995 --> 00:02:16.462
CAUSED THE CRIME RATE TO GO UP

00:02:16.463 --> 00:02:18.630
AND IT WAS CAUSING ECONOMIC

00:02:18.631 --> 00:02:20.399
PRESSURE ON ORDINARY GERMANS.

00:02:20.400 --> 00:02:21.633
BUT PEOPLE WEREN'T ALLOW TO

00:02:21.634 --> 00:02:23.135
SAY THAT FOR A NUMBER OF YEARS

00:02:23.136 --> 00:02:25.170
IN PUBLIC.

00:02:25.171 --> 00:02:26.905
OR AM I MISREADING IT?

00:02:26.906 --> 00:02:28.240
&gt;&gt; NO, YOU ARE RIGHT.

00:02:28.241 --> 00:02:29.908
I'D GO SO FAR TO SAY WE STILL

00:02:29.909 --> 00:02:31.010
HAVE THE PROBLEM IN GERMANY.

00:02:31.011 --> 00:02:32.378
THERE IS STILL AN OVERREACTION

00:02:32.379 --> 00:02:34.213
IF YOU COMPLAINT ABOUT WANTING

00:02:34.214 --> 00:02:36.515
SECURE BORDERS OR -- IF YOU

00:02:36.516 --> 00:02:38.350
COMPLAIN ABOUT WANTING SECURE

00:02:38.351 --> 00:02:45.691
BORDERS OR AN ORDERLY PROCESS.

00:02:45.692 --> 00:02:47.659
THIS IS NOT WHETHER YOU HAVE A

00:02:47.660 --> 00:02:47.960
HEART.

00:02:47.961 --> 00:02:48.627
THIS IS WHETHER OR NOT YOU

00:02:48.628 --> 00:02:49.128
HAVE A PLAN.

00:02:49.129 --> 00:02:50.229
WE IN THE UNITED STATES KNOW A

00:02:50.230 --> 00:02:53.532
MILLION PEOPLE A YEAR GET

00:02:53.533 --> 00:02:54.333
U.S. CITIZENSHIP.

00:02:54.334 --> 00:02:55.701
WE ARE VERY GENEROUS.

00:02:55.702 --> 00:03:00.472
THIS IS NOT WANTING IMMIGRANT

00:03:00.473 --> 00:03:02.741
IMMIGRANTS.

00:03:02.742 --> 00:03:05.778
THEY THAT THE LEFT -- THE IDEA

00:03:05.779 --> 00:03:07.246
THAT THE LEFT OR THE RIGHT OR

00:03:07.247 --> 00:03:11.283
THE MEDIA IS MIXING UP LEGAL

00:03:11.284 --> 00:03:12.651
IMMIGRATION WITH ILLEGAL

00:03:12.652 --> 00:03:13.886
IMMIGRATION IS AN OUTRAGE.

00:03:13.887 --> 00:03:14.987
THOSE OF US IN THE PUBLIC

00:03:14.988 --> 00:03:16.188
POLICY POSITIONS HAVE TO PUSH

00:03:16.189 --> 00:03:17.556
BACK AND SAY LOOK, WE ARE NOT

00:03:17.557 --> 00:03:19.024
TALKING ABOUT LEGAL

00:03:19.025 --> 00:03:19.458
IMMIGRATION.

00:03:19.459 --> 00:03:21.460
THE UNITED STATES IS GENEROUS.

00:03:21.461 --> 00:03:22.895
GERMANY HAS BEEN GENEROUS.

00:03:22.896 --> 00:03:23.996
THIS IS ABOUT WHETHER OR NOT

00:03:23.997 --> 00:03:24.696
YOU HAVE A PLAN.

00:03:24.697 --> 00:03:25.798
BECAUSE NOT EVERYONE IS GOING

00:03:25.799 --> 00:03:26.832
TO BE ABLE TO COME.

00:03:26.833 --> 00:03:28.400
THAT IS WHAT YOU HAVE TO BE

00:03:28.401 --> 00:03:29.201
ABLE TO SAY.

00:03:29.202 --> 00:03:33.172
WE MUST PRIORITIZE.

00:03:33.173 --> 00:03:35.574
WHAT IS THAT NUMBER?

00:03:35.575 --> 00:03:37.109
1 MILLION PEOPLE IN THE UNITED

00:03:37.110 --> 00:03:37.443
STATES.

00:03:37.444 --> 00:03:38.477
IS IT 4 MILLION PEOPLE IN

00:03:38.478 --> 00:03:40.412
GERMANY OVER A NUMBER OF

00:03:40.413 --> 00:03:40.746
YEARS?

00:03:40.747 --> 00:03:42.781
WHAT IS THAT NUMBER?

00:03:42.782 --> 00:03:43.882
BECAUSE WHATEVER THAT NUMBER

00:03:43.883 --> 00:03:45.617
IS STILL GOING TO BE TOO LOW.

00:03:45.618 --> 00:03:46.885
YOU ARE STILL GOING TO TURN

00:03:46.886 --> 00:03:47.553
PEOPLE AWAY.

00:03:47.554 --> 00:03:49.221
LET'S HAVE AN ORDERLY PROCESS

00:03:49.222 --> 00:03:51.290
AND FIGURE OUT HOW TO DO LEGAL

00:03:51.291 --> 00:03:52.424
IMMIGRATION AND DO IT THE

00:03:52.425 --> 00:03:52.925
RIGHT WAY.

00:03:52.926 --> 00:03:54.193
&gt;&gt; Tucker: ARE PEOPLE -- I

00:03:54.194 --> 00:03:55.461
THINK THAT IS WHAT WE NEED IN

00:03:55.462 --> 00:03:56.328
THE UNITED STATES.

00:03:56.329 --> 00:03:57.096
HONEST ADULT CONVERSATION

00:03:57.097 --> 00:03:58.597
ABOUT WHAT WE CAN AFFORD, WHAT

00:03:58.598 --> 00:04:00.199
IS GOOD FOR YOUR COUNTRY AND

00:04:00.200 --> 00:04:02.835
WHAT THE NEXT 100 YEARS LOOKS

00:04:02.836 --> 00:04:05.704
LIKE DEMOGRAPHICALLY.

00:04:05.705 --> 00:04:06.939
WE CAN'T HAVE THE CONVERSATION

00:04:06.940 --> 00:04:07.573
HERE.

00:04:07.574 --> 00:04:08.607
CAN GERMANS HAVE IT?

00:04:08.608 --> 00:04:09.308
&gt;&gt; I THINK THE UNITED STATES

00:04:09.309 --> 00:04:10.476
IS HAVING A BETTER

00:04:10.477 --> 00:04:11.410
CONVERSATION THAN GERMANS TO

00:04:11.411 --> 00:04:14.046
BE HONEST.

00:04:14.047 --> 00:04:16.949
THIS HAS LARGELY BEEN

00:04:16.950 --> 00:04:18.450
CONTROLLED BY ELITES IN

00:04:18.451 --> 00:04:18.817
BERLIN.

00:04:18.818 --> 00:04:19.985
BUT NORMAL, EVERYDAY PEOPLE

00:04:19.986 --> 00:04:21.420
ARE BEGINNING TO SAY WAIT A

00:04:21.421 --> 00:04:22.654
MINUTE, THIS POLICY IS NOT

00:04:22.655 --> 00:04:22.988
WORKING.

00:04:22.989 --> 00:04:24.456
THIS IS NOT ABOUT BEING

00:04:24.457 --> 00:04:25.057
GENEROUS.

00:04:25.058 --> 00:04:26.191
WE ARE VERY GENEROUS.

00:04:26.192 --> 00:04:27.993
THEY HAVE A LOT OF OPEN

00:04:27.994 --> 00:04:28.794
BORDERS THROUGHOUT EUROPE.

00:04:28.795 --> 00:04:30.095
BUT I WOULD ALSO ARGUE THAT

00:04:30.096 --> 00:04:32.464
THE MISTAKES OF GERMANY,

00:04:32.465 --> 00:04:34.366
TUCKER, RIPPLED THROUGHOUT ALL

00:04:34.367 --> 00:04:36.502
OF EUROPE BECAUSE WE HAVE SEEN

00:04:36.503 --> 00:04:45.177
IN AUSTRIA WITH SEBASTIAN

00:04:45.178 --> 00:04:46.912
CURTIS WHO CAME IN WITH A PLAN

00:04:46.913 --> 00:04:48.180
AND SAY WE NEED SECURITY AND A

00:04:48.181 --> 00:04:48.914
SET OF RULES.

00:04:48.915 --> 00:04:50.249
THIS IS NOT ABOUT BEING

00:04:50.250 --> 00:04:51.850
GENEROUS OR NOT BEING OPEN TO

00:04:51.851 --> 00:04:56.355
IMMIGRANTS BUT JUST HAVING

00:04:56.356 --> 00:04:57.589
RULES.

00:04:57.590 --> 00:04:58.590
ONCE HE ESTABLISHED THAT HE

00:04:58.591 --> 00:05:00.058
WANTED RULES HE WON IN A BIG

00:05:00.059 --> 00:05:02.027
WAY AND IS NOW BECOME POPULAR

00:05:02.028 --> 00:05:02.861
THROUGHOUT GERMANY.

00:05:02.862 --> 00:05:03.662
&gt;&gt; Tucker: YES.

00:05:03.663 --> 00:05:05.097
&gt;&gt; SO WHILE SOME IN THE MEDIA

00:05:05.098 --> 00:05:07.099
AND GERMANY WILL TRY TO PUSH

00:05:07.100 --> 00:05:08.767
THIS INTO SAYING YOU ARE A

00:05:08.768 --> 00:05:11.270
RADICAL FAR RIGHT PERSON, THE

00:05:11.271 --> 00:05:12.838
REALITY IS THAT NORMAL

00:05:12.839 --> 00:05:15.707
EVERYDAY GERMANS AND EUROPEANS

00:05:15.708 --> 00:05:17.342
ARE CLAMORING FOR LEADERS WHO

00:05:17.343 --> 00:05:19.044
WANTS TO HAVE SAFE AND SECURE

00:05:19.045 --> 00:05:20.279
BORDERS AND AN ORDERLY

00:05:20.280 --> 00:05:20.679
PROCESS.

00:05:20.680 --> 00:05:21.980
&gt;&gt; Tucker: IF THEY WANT

00:05:21.981 --> 00:05:24.016
CREATE RADICALS THEY COULD

00:05:24.017 --> 00:05:26.519
KEEP LYING TO THE POPULATION.

